      "text": "Amazing news!\n\nTexas Children's opens the nation's first detransition clinic. Now the hospital has to pay to help undo the damage.\n\nUnder a $10 million settlement with Texas Attorney General Ken Paxton over billing Texas Medicaid for 'gender-transition' interventions, Texas Children's Hospital in Houston has opened what Paxton calls the nation's first detransition clinic. The hospital must fully fund the clinic's care for its first five years, so patients pay nothing.\n\nServices include endocrinology, surgery, primary care, fertility counseling, psychiatry, psychology, social work and case management, and speech pathology.\n\nhttps://billboardchris.com/news/2026-10-27-texas-childrens-detransition-clinic",
