    {
      "id": "2115126996217008612",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-27T17:02:27.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-28 01:02:27",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "When @Starlink helped save a man’s life during emergency surgery in rural Zimbabwe.\n\nA young man suffered severe burns to his leg after falling into a cooking fire during a seizure. His parents spent hours helping him reach a remote hospital in Chisizya.\n\nDr. Mike Jeans needed to perform an emergency operation he had never done before. Using Starlink, he called a colleague in South Africa, who guided him through the surgery.\n\nThe operation succeeded. The patient was transferred by ambulance to a larger hospital. MATTER, the charity involved, reported that he survived and was recovering.\n\nStarlink connected a doctor to lifesaving medical guidance when his patient needed it most.\n\nThis is why Starlink matters. A working connection can help save a life. This lifesaving technology should be available in every part of the world.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
        "author": "cb_doge",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1498070100393754625/C2V-fbll_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-27 02:19:56",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-26T18:19:56.000Z",
        "id": "2114784107389698172",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVk47pdaQAAzeQi.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
